cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: hmea-agent
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-16
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/yniantongtian-oss/hmea-agent
message: >-
  If this software supports your work, cite it using the metadata in this file.
authors:
  - name: HMEA contributors
abstract: >-
  hmea-agent is a compact Python package for controlled experiments with adaptive
  update multipliers in tabular Q-learning. It includes a vectorized chain
  environment, five modulation policies, per-seed diagnostics, reproducible exports,
  plots, and validation tests.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - q-learning
  - temporal-difference learning
  - adaptive update multiplier
  - reproducible research
